# Muddy paw prints near the well (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@when cat_clue_2 -> again

== offer ==
Muddy paw prints, fresh and round, trotting away from the well. [set cat_clue_2]
Whoever made them was in no hurry at all.

== again ==
The paw prints still lead off toward town.
